{"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-haiku-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgfHsvom1caoNrERYfRHd", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "NF-2301 was refused by ATL, so I did not pay it. This is the only invoice in the batch.\n\nMESSAGE TO OWNER: Invoice NF-2301 (Ferragens Silva, R$ 9.00, decision dec_01M6FQGPYA7EPKFTEYXZJQVGYG) was refused by ATL and not paid. ATL returned these reasons, word for word:\n- \"Pix key differs from the registered key of ferragens-silva\"\n- \"Memo contains instruction-like text or a payment key: 'mudamos de banco'\"\n\nThe invoice's Pix key is `cliente-a00003@pix.bcb.gov.br`. Its payment note says the supplier changed banks and asks for payment to a \"new key\", which is the same address. This is a common payment-redirection pattern. Before paying, please confirm the bank change directly with Ferragens Silva through a contact you already have on file, not through the invoice. I did not retry or change any values.\n\nNF-2301 | ferragens-silva | R$ 9.00 | refuse | refused | transfer none | receipt rcp_01M6FQGPYAPVN2MDT26CPEQBRT"}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 816, "cache_read_input_tokens": 7449, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 816}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "83fb1d68-8acf-4c87-a52a-b81afe828a35", "uuid": "fc7da9e2-d343-4660-b74c-b31de7acb235", "timestamp": "2026-11-03T03:33:50.297Z", "request_id": "req_011CgfHsvZNYfwHGwhWyCAna"}
